      "widgets_values": [
        "Browser ONNX milestone \u00b7 local execution on the viewing device. Load a local image/video/GIF in 2D stream, or connect a camera. Source is explicitly resized to 256\u00d7256. \u2193 downloads verified public model/runtime artifacts (~34.7 MB); \u2191 loads/warms the selected model/backend; \u25b6 starts live processing; \u00d7 unloads. Keep delivery Live. WASM CPU is an explicit alternative; no automatic fallback. Queue uses the separate native Real-ESRGAN node. Compare source/2x/4x. Larger sources need an upstream resize. No temporal history. Credits and benchmark limits: ?."
